<p>The Circle of Fifths can also be used to help to learn chords. You alrea=
dy know that the Circle goes in Fifths clockwise. Now look at how close the=
 chords that are a fifth apart are together on the fretboard. You might not=
 use this too much, but it will give you a broader view of the chords and h=
ow they are related to other chords.</p>
